# The jobs of Nidhogg's build.yml that build the tarballs drgnx's line mode installs: ARTIFACT|JOB NAME, the name the
# run's job list shows (`name:` of the job, matrix values filled in). nidhogg-line.sh's job_of must give each ARTIFACT's
# name here (the ci-workflows test holds it); a rename in Nidhogg's build.yml changes this file and job_of together, or
# no run ever matches (the "macOS (NS app)" -> "macOS (Naglfar app)" rename did exactly that).
tarball-fedora-45|Linux (fedora-45)
tarball-macos|macOS (Naglfar app)
